                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "11dfc85d-7922-3f4b-92a4-bc9ff7ef1b1d",
                        "entry_id": "56cb8b2b-3c0d-309e-902b-797467d9bb75",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An electronic slide presentation."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b96d0646-f607-4e43-a3b1-975f523b6523",
                                "sense_id": "11dfc85d-7922-3f4b-92a4-bc9ff7ef1b1d",
                                "text": "The powerpoint shows the same model type of the Mitsubishi train, Crystal Mover, being run in Singapore's light rail transit."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "53f8c14f-c86d-37d0-a7b2-06ad7db1b126",
                "word": "PowerPoint",
                "pos": "verb",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "15e7815c-4883-4a98-8246-4db06d4233a8",
                        "entry_id": "53f8c14f-c86d-37d0-a7b2-06ad7db1b126",
                        "tags": [
                            "present",
                            "singular",
                            "third-person"
                        ],
                        "form": "PowerPoints"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "059b9992-7113-48a9-967d-50764f8a9abc",
                        "entry_id": "53f8c14f-c86d-37d0-a7b2-06ad7db1b126",
                        "tags": [
                            "participle",
                            "present"
                        ],
                        "form": "PowerPointing"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "b06bf45c-9cc8-4231-87a1-d4b6334e01af",
                        "entry_id": "53f8c14f-c86d-37d0-a7b2-06ad7db1b126",
                        "tags": [
                            "participle",
                            "past"
                        ],
                        "form": "PowerPointed"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "cf7a5b6e-78b2-4b13-bdbc-dcf402cd9ef3",
                        "entry_id": "53f8c14f-c86d-37d0-a7b2-06ad7db1b126",
                        "tags": [
                            "past"
                        ],
                        "form": "PowerPointed"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4c713fe2-8fb3-3353-a815-3908b94d4977",
                        "entry_id": "53f8c14f-c86d-37d0-a7b2-06ad7db1b126",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To communicate using electronic slides."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "intransitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d863e47f-eaef-4bea-ba68-902effb38ee3",
                                "sense_id": "4c713fe2-8fb3-3353-a815-3908b94d4977",
                                "text": "A recent editorial and tips in this journal have extolled the virtues of making clear presentations using computer presentation software, in particular the commercial software PowerPoint (Microsoft, Redmond, WA). AJR readers may be interested to know that free software packages are available that can create professional presentations without furthering our national dependence on a software monopoly."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "18da5885-5a27-4fa3-8aff-549145d2e776",
                                "sense_id": "4c713fe2-8fb3-3353-a815-3908b94d4977",
                                "text": "Levi seems to be able to do all the slide shows and videos and PowerPointing his teachers ask of him -- as long as he's patient with its slow pace"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2acc5c66-c51f-43c9-9812-755adffaf203",
                                "sense_id": "4c713fe2-8fb3-3353-a815-3908b94d4977",
                                "text": "As the world is now texting, tweeting, and PowerPointing all over the place, this edition of English Grammar For Dummies shows you how to handle all sorts of electronic communications"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "240516ea-ebdc-3ec5-9d69-f4427f6ca4a5",
                        "entry_id": "53f8c14f-c86d-37d0-a7b2-06ad7db1b126",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To present (a topic) by means of electronic slides."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "transitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5488f0e6-e9c1-42e2-85bc-ef72a274b027",
                                "sense_id": "240516ea-ebdc-3ec5-9d69-f4427f6ca4a5",
                                "text": "Do they tell a person (as happens in one corporation) that they won't look at any report unless it is “PowerPointed”?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "df772578-169d-41f5-8a8b-8decfa3696cf",
                                "sense_id": "240516ea-ebdc-3ec5-9d69-f4427f6ca4a5",
                                "text": "In one poignant moment, Hanks is sitting in on an executive meeting at a major toy company, and one vice president is PowerPointing his way through a presentation about a new toy"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7faa798a-918d-4ab1-ac2c-bd5a9f466a72",
                                "sense_id": "240516ea-ebdc-3ec5-9d69-f4427f6ca4a5",
                                "text": "As I write this, Gottfried is PowerPointing the concept around a string of high-level development companies across the United States."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3d951f27-d799-4490-a0f5-48a04f2fde56",
                                "sense_id": "240516ea-ebdc-3ec5-9d69-f4427f6ca4a5",
                                "text": "So we quickly and efficiently did our research and, in a blink of an eye, the “known unknowns” quickly became known and PowerPointed"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "29e41303-f452-3ca4-9333-45ef515a3453",
                        "entry_id": "53f8c14f-c86d-37d0-a7b2-06ad7db1b126",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To communicate to (an audience) by electronic slides."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "transitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c7fef631-9e84-4fd5-8684-e81c01c6f84e",
                                "sense_id": "29e41303-f452-3ca4-9333-45ef515a3453",
                                "text": "She says the audience has had a long day and has been \"PowerPointed out\" with one presentation after another from other Oracle executives"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3f7e982e-4a8c-48e9-817f-79a22ca518ee",
                                "sense_id": "29e41303-f452-3ca4-9333-45ef515a3453",
                                "text": "Now it is time to take your tired-as-hell, PowerPointed-to-death brain and shake things up so that you have the ideas, energy,"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ee4163ee-768b-4762-9656-37d7034c5c7f",
                                "sense_id": "29e41303-f452-3ca4-9333-45ef515a3453",
                                "text": "Instead of being talked at, briefed, and PowerPointed, you will be drawing on your experience, listening to others, and figuring out what it all means"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
